B.GQ=new A.bP("humor","Strategy B \xb7 Humorous Icebreaker","\u201cFrom that look, I know this draft hasn't earned your gold star yet! Give me two pointers and I'll polish it into something we're both proud of.\u201d","\u3010Positive Reframing\u3011: Reframes critique into mentorship, preserving authority while demonstrating high coachability and resilience.")
